   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c02_setup_eig` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c02_setup_eig\", 0.68, {{\"states, largest sector\", {64, 10}}, {\"max eigen-residual of t_a at x = 19/23\", 0 (acc 1e-52)}, {\"min eigenvalue gap in sectors\", 0.0032182482462518359}, \n  {\"max |Im ev|\", 0}, {\"times (s): numeric t, eigensystems, polynomials\", {0.2174397, 0.0183217, 0.327215}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c02_setup_eig\", 4.78, {{\"states, largest sector\", {225, 18}}, {\"max eigen-residual of t_a at x = 19/23\", 0 (acc 1e-50)}, {\"min eigenvalue gap in sectors\", 0.0063945312186581642}, \n  {\"max |Im ev|\", 0}, {\"times (s): numeric t, eigensystems, polynomials\", {0.8797074, 0.1839949, 3.1449517}}}}\n```",
