   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c03_setup_Q` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c03_setup_Q\", 0.53, {{\"all 3 x nS dual Q's found, null dims\", {True, {1}}}, {\"max relative Baxter residual\", 0 (acc 1e-49)}, {\"degrees of q^j: min, max\", {0, 4}}, \n  {\"times (s): Q solve, ladder values\", {0.3539648, 0.0773745}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c03_setup_Q\", 1.8900000000000001, {{\"all 3 x nS dual Q's found, null dims\", {True, {1}}}, {\"max relative Baxter residual\", 0 (acc 1e-47)}, {\"degrees of q^j: min, max\", {0, 6}}, \n  {\"times (s): Q solve, ladder values\", {1.1776638, 0.2533138}}}}\n```",
