  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* physical-space Gauss factors P_phys = Pm . diag(s) . Pp (rep-independent group data), the SoV vacuum x0 = (e1 P_phys^-1) tensor 2 and the companion-frame kets (P^-1 tensor P^-1) psi *)\nρdiag[d_] := DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[d[[k]]^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\nsVec[zv_] := {zv[[1]]^2/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]])), -(zv[[2]]/(zv[[1]] (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))), 1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])};\nrVec[zv_] := {-(zv[[3]]/zv[[2]]), -(zv[[3]]/zv[[1]]), (zv[[2]]^2 (zv[[3]] - zv[[1]]))/(zv[[1]]^2 (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))};\nPphys[zv_] := nexp[rVec[zv][[1]] Ee[3, 2]] . nexp[rVec[zv][[2]] Ee[3, 1]] . nexp[rVec[zv][[3]] Ee[2, 1]] . ρdiag[sVec[zv]] . nexp[(1/zv[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]] . nexp[-(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . nexp[((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]];\nPph1 = Normal[Pphys[zN]]; PphInv1 = Inverse[Pph1];\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\nx01 = e1 . PphInv1; x02 = kron[x01, x01]; x0C = kron[e1, e1];\nx0ovl = Table[x02 . vecS[[A]], {A, nS}];\n{tims[\"companion kets\"], ketC} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[N[Flatten[PphInv1 . Partition[vecS[[A]], d1] . Transpose[PphInv1]], prec], {A, nS}]];\nchecks[\"companion kets: <x0C|ket> = diagonal-frame <x0|psi> (max rel)\"] = Max[Table[Abs[x0C . ketC[[A]] - x0ovl[[A]]]/Abs[x0ovl[[A]]], {A, nS}]];\nchecks[\"<x0|Psi> nonzero (min |.|, not a zero test)\"] = Min[Abs[x0ovl]];\nGrid[{{\"companion kets vs diagonal frame <x0|psi> (max rel dev)\", N[checks[\"companion kets: <x0C|ket> = diagonal-frame <x0|psi> (max rel)\"], 3]}, {\"min |<x0|Psi>| over states\", N[checks[\"<x0|Psi> nonzero (min |.|, not a zero test)\"], 4]}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"companion kets\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
