   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c04_setup_kets` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c04_setup_kets\", 0.04, {{\"companion kets vs diagonal frame <x0|psi> (max rel dev)\", 0 (acc 1e-54)}, {\"min |<x0|Psi>| over states\", 0.0001426647792380921}, {\"time (s)\", 0.0158493}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c04_setup_kets\", 0.37, {{\"companion kets vs diagonal frame <x0|psi> (max rel dev)\", 0 (acc 1e-49)}, {\"min |<x0|Psi>| over states\", 4.2636133239697*^-6}, {\"time (s)\", 0.3326328}}}\n```",
