  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c05_sov_B` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c05_sov_B\", 0.32, {{\"B eigensystem: gap (min), time (s)\", {0.0000157519231408742, 0.0215242}}, {\"all roots on ladders 3+3\", True}, {\"|rule| = dim V; triples = rule set (both sites)\", {8, True}}, \n  {\"# distinct label pairs\", 64}, {\"vacuum label pair present, index\", {True, 1}}, {\"label (a|bc) <-> sorted triple of root offsets (theta_s + offset h)\", \n   {{\"(a|bc) = (1|00)\", {-2, 0, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (1|10)\", {-2, -1, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (1|11)\", {-2, -1, -1}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|00)\", {-3, 0, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|10)\", {-3, -1, 0}}, \n    {\"(a|bc) = (2|20)\", {-3, -2, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|11)\", {-3, -1, -1}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|21)\", {-3, -2, -1}}}}, {\"x0 vacuum eigenvector\", {True, 0 (acc 1e-60)}}, \n  {\"times (s): B(7 pts), roots\", {0.0454424, 0.2211768}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c05_sov_B\", 2.44, {{\"B eigensystem: gap (min), time (s)\", {4.8173357178402*^-6, 0.3544045}}, {\"all roots on ladders 3+3\", True}, {\"|rule| = dim V; triples = rule set (both sites)\", {15, True}}, \n  {\"# distinct label pairs\", 225}, {\"vacuum label pair present, index\", {True, 1}}, {\"label (a|bc) <-> sorted triple of root offsets (theta_s + offset h)\", \n   {{\"(a|bc) = (1|00)\", {-2, 0, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (1|10)\", {-2, -1, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (1|11)\", {-2, -1, -1}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|00)\", {-3, 0, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|10)\", {-3, -1, 0}}, \n    {\"(a|bc) = (2|20)\", {-3, -2, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|11)\", {-3, -1, -1}}, {\"(a|bc) = (2|21)\", {-3, -2, -1}}, {\"(a|bc) = (3|00)\", {-4, 0, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (3|10)\", {-4, -1, 0}}, \n    {\"(a|bc) = (3|20)\", {-4, -2, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (3|30)\", {-4, -3, 0}}, {\"(a|bc) = (3|11)\", {-4, -1, -1}}, {\"(a|bc) = (3|21)\", {-4, -2, -1}}, {\"(a|bc) = (3|31)\", {-4, -3, -1}}}}, \n  {\"x0 vacuum eigenvector\", {True, 0 (acc 1e-60)}}, {\"times (s): B(7 pts), roots\", {0.1820326, 1.7570194}}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
