   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c06_sov_wf` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c06_sov_wf\", 0.25, {{\"max rel dev of <x_m|Psi_B>/<x0|Psi_B> vs N_m prod M (rows12 k1, rows23 k3, rows13 k2)\", {0 (acc 1e-43), 0 (acc 1e-46), 0 (acc 1e-46)}}, \n  {\"min |predicted ratio| (zero-division guard)\", {0.0045095014446884126, 0.0045095014446884126, 0.0045095014446884126}}, \n  {\"N_m identical across conventions (max rel diff)\", 0 (acc 1e-46)}, {\"N_m: min, max abs\", {0.0540389452942011766, 2.0850268681723548077}}, \n  {\"time (s): overlaps, tests\", {0.0156231, 0.1695345}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c06_sov_wf\", 4.53, {{\"max rel dev of <x_m|Psi_B>/<x0|Psi_B> vs N_m prod M (rows12 k1, rows23 k3, rows13 k2)\", {0 (acc 1e-39), 0 (acc 1e-43), 0 (acc 1e-43)}}, \n  {\"min |predicted ratio| (zero-division guard)\", {0.0000109488830552096, 0.0000109488830552096, 0.0000109488830552096}}, \n  {\"N_m identical across conventions (max rel diff)\", 0 (acc 1e-43)}, {\"N_m: min, max abs\", {0.0139721805858270838, 4.7735207151195373614}}, \n  {\"time (s): overlaps, tests\", {0.4126553, 1.5697377}}}}\n```",
