  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Setup regression (cells 1-6 above; two runs, `Λ` changed in the first code cell)\n\n| check | [2,1,0] (dim 8, 64 states) | [3,1,0] (dim 15, 225 states) |\n|---|---|---|\n| quantum determinant t3 = chi3 nu1(x) nu2(x-h) nu3(x-2h), exact | True | True |\n| # eigenstates; largest weight sector; min eigenvalue gap in a sector | 64; 10; 3.2e-3 | 225; 18; 6.4e-3 |\n| max abs residual of t_a psi = lambda_a psi at x = 19/23 | < 1e-52 | < 1e-50 |\n| dual Q's found at deg q^j = mu_j (null-space dim 1); dual Baxter residual | True; < 1e-49 | True; < 1e-47 |\n| companion kets: <x0C\\|ket> = diagonal-frame <x0\\|psi>, max rel dev | < 1e-54 | < 1e-49 |\n| B(u): eigensystem gap; all roots on the two ladders 3+3; rule set size = dim V | 1.6e-5; True; 8, True | 4.8e-6; True; 15, True |\n| # distinct (site-1, site-2) label pairs; vacuum pair present; x0 = e1 (x) e1 exact eigen-covector | 64; True; True | 225; True; True |\n| **label rule** (a\\|bc): lambda2 <= a <= lambda1, 0 <= c <= lambda2, c <= b <= a, roots theta_s + {-1-a,-b,-c} h | reproduced, both sites | reproduced, both sites |\n| **wavefunction monomial** <x_m\\|Psi>/<x0\\|Psi> = N_m prod_s M^(s)_m/M^(s)_vac, max rel dev over all labels x states, rows{1,2}/k=1, {2,3}/3, {1,3}/2 | < 1e-43 / 1e-46 / 1e-46 | < 1e-39 / 1e-43 / 1e-43 |\n| N_m identical across the three conventions | < 1e-46 | < 1e-43 |\n| times (s): cells 1-6 (setup, eigenstates, Q's, kets, B, wavefunction test) | 0.8 | 6.8 |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
