  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 0: the one-site vacuum covector. Omega_c[w] = e1 exp(E12/w1) exp(-E13/(w1 w2)) exp((w1+w2)/(w1 w2) E23) is the Gauss rotation gaussCov[{alpha, beta, gamma}] with alpha = 1/w1, beta = -1/(w1 w2), gamma = (w1+w2)/(w1 w2); with s = 1/w2 this is (alpha, -alpha s, alpha + s), polynomial in (alpha, s), and beta + alpha gamma = alpha^2 (first row (1, alpha, alpha^2)). All exact. *)\ngaussCov[{al_, be_, ga_}] := e1 . nexp[al Ee[1, 2]] . nexp[be Ee[1, 3]] . nexp[ga Ee[2, 3]];\ngaussParOf[w_] := {1/w[[1]], -1/(w[[1]] w[[2]]), (w[[1]] + w[[2]])/(w[[1]] w[[2]])};\nΩc[w_] := Normal[gaussCov[gaussParOf[Take[w, 2]]]];\nPppW[y_] := MatrixExp[(1/y[[1]]) Normal[Ee[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[-(1/(y[[1]] y[[2]])) Normal[Ee[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[((y[[1]] + y[[2]])/(y[[1]] y[[2]])) Normal[Ee[2, 3]]];\nwN = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}; wP = {7/4, -2/5, 9/7};\nchecks[\"Omega_c[w] = e1 exp(E12/w1) exp(-E13/(w1 w2)) exp(...E23): exact, w, w', 2 more\"] = Table[Union[Flatten[Ωc[w] - e1 . PppW[w]]] === {0}, {w, {wN, wP, {2/3, -5/7}, {-3/2, 4/5}}}];\nee3b[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii] KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];\nPp3[w1_, w2_] := MatrixExp[ee3b[1, 2]/w1] . MatrixExp[-ee3b[1, 3]/(w1 w2)] . MatrixExp[((w1 + w2)/(w1 w2)) ee3b[2, 3]];\nchecks[\"3x3 first row of the Gauss product = (1, 1/w1, 1/w1^2), symbolic\"] = Simplify[Pp3[ww1, ww2][[1]] - {1, 1/ww1, 1/ww1^2}] === {0, 0, 0};\nchecks[\"beta + alpha gamma - alpha^2 = 0 on the vacuum Gauss parameters, symbolic\"] = Simplify[gaussParOf[{ww1, ww2}][[2]] + gaussParOf[{ww1, ww2}][[1]] gaussParOf[{ww1, ww2}][[3]] - gaussParOf[{ww1, ww2}][[1]]^2] === 0;\n(* (alpha, s) coordinates: Omega_c = gaussCov[{al, -al s, al + s}] *)\ngaussVac[{al_, s_}] := gaussCov[{al, -al s, al + s}];\nchecks[\"Omega_c[w] = gaussVac[{1/w1, 1/w2}] (exact, w, w')\"] = Table[Union[Flatten[Ωc[w] - Normal[gaussVac[{1/w[[1]], 1/w[[2]]}]]]] === {0}, {w, {wN, wP}}];\nGrid[{{\"Omega_c[w] = exact rep exponentials (4 points)\", checks[\"Omega_c[w] = e1 exp(E12/w1) exp(-E13/(w1 w2)) exp(...E23): exact, w, w', 2 more\"]}, {\"first row (1, 1/w1, 1/w1^2) symbolic; beta + alpha gamma = alpha^2 symbolic\", {checks[\"3x3 first row of the Gauss product = (1, 1/w1, 1/w1^2), symbolic\"], checks[\"beta + alpha gamma - alpha^2 = 0 on the vacuum Gauss parameters, symbolic\"]}}, {\"Omega_c[w] = gaussVac[{1/w1, 1/w2}] (alpha, s) form\", checks[\"Omega_c[w] = gaussVac[{1/w1, 1/w2}] (exact, w, w')\"]}, {\"w, w'\", {wN, wP}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c07_t0_omega` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c07_t0_omega\", 0.05, {{\"Omega_c[w] = exact rep exponentials (4 points)\", {True, True, True, True}}, {\"first row (1, 1/w1, 1/w1^2) symbolic; beta + alpha gamma = alpha^2 symbolic\", {True, True}}, \n  {\"Omega_c[w] = gaussVac[{1/w1, 1/w2}] (alpha, s) form\", {True, True}}, {\"w, w'\", {{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, {7/4, -2/5, 9/7}}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c07_t0_omega\", 0.12, {{\"Omega_c[w] = exact rep exponentials (4 points)\", {True, True, True, True}}, {\"first row (1, 1/w1, 1/w1^2) symbolic; beta + alpha gamma = alpha^2 symbolic\", {True, True}}, \n  {\"Omega_c[w] = gaussVac[{1/w1, 1/w2}] (alpha, s) form\", {True, True}}, {\"w, w'\", {{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, {7/4, -2/5, 9/7}}}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
