  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 0: the det6 overlap machinery, rep-generic (pattern of L2-310-two-rotations cell 17). Omega_c[w] (x) Omega_c[w] is the exact eigen-covector of t_a(x) built with the companion-matrix twist G(w); its eigenvalue polynomials tau_a (7-point Lagrange interpolation, exact) feed the DIRECT Baxter equation with w_i in place of z_i, giving the vacuum direct Q's F_i. det6 has poles {s, n}, n = lambda3..lambda1 on each ladder, insertions 1 and exp(2 pi i x/h), rows (i, j) in {(1,3), (1,2), (2,3)}. Reference Psi_Q = vacuum monomial product on both ladders with the triple (lambda1+1, lambda1, lambda2). *)\nGcomp[{a_, b_, c_}] := {{a + b + c, -(a b + a c + b c), a b c}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nlagQ[k_] := Product[(u - uPts[[l]])/(uPts[[k]] - uPts[[l]]), {l, DeleteCases[Range[7], k]}];\nsizeQ[x_] := If[x == 0, 10.^-Accuracy[x], N[Abs[x], 3]];\nopDir[tt_, Q_, x_] := nuP[1][x] nuP[1][x + hN] nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x - hN] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) nuP[1][x + hN] nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + hN) nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x + hN] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2 hN) Q[x + 2 hN];\n(* minimal-degree monic q with Q = zz^(s x/h) q solving op; {} if none up to degree 8 *)\nsolveQ[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{cq, eqs, ns, res = {}}, Do[If[res === {}, eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[op[tt, Function[yy, zz^(s (yy - X)/hN) Sum[cq[j] yy^j, {j, 0, d}]], X]], 10^-40], X]; ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, cq[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], prec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]]; If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, X, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 8}]; res];\nqResid[op_, tt_, zz_, s_, q_] := Max[Abs[CoefficientList[Expand[op[tt, Function[yy, zz^(s (yy - X)/hN) (q /. X -> yy)], X]], X]]];\n(* vacuum data of the bra twist w = (w1, w2, w3): exact tau_a, direct Q's *)\nvacData[w_] := vacData[w] = Module[{Om2 = kron[Ωc[w], Ωc[w]], M = Gcomp[w], kOm, tau, qd, eigOK, res},\n   kOm = Ordering[Abs[Om2], -1][[1]];\n   tau = Table[Expand[Sum[lagQ[m] (Om2 . tL2[a, uPts[[m]], M])[[kOm]]/Om2[[kOm]], {m, 7}]], {a, 3}];\n   eigOK = And @@ Flatten[Table[SubsetQ[{0}, Union[Normal[Om2 . tL2[a, x, M] - (tau[[a]] /. u -> x) Om2]]], {a, 3}, {x, Append[uPts, 2/9]}]];\n   qd = Table[solveQ[opDir, N[tau, prec], w[[i]], -1], {i, 3}];\n   res = If[FreeQ[qd, {}], Max[Table[qResid[opDir, N[tau, prec], w[[i]], -1, qd[[i]]], {i, 3}]], \"not found\"];\n   <|\"Om2\" -> Om2, \"tau\" -> tau, \"qd\" -> qd, \"eigOK\" -> eigOK, \"resid\" -> res, \"deg\" -> If[FreeQ[qd, {}], Exponent[qd, X], \"nf\"]|>];\nFvacOf[w_][i_, x_] := FvacOf[w][i, x] = N[w[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (vacData[w][\"qd\"][[i]] /. X -> x);\nQUm[A_, j_, x_] := QUm[A, j, x] = N[zN[[j]]^(x/hN), prec] (qu[[A, j]] /. X -> x);\npoles = Flatten[Table[{s, n}, {s, nL}, {n, Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]}], 1];\nxP[{s_, n_}] := thN[[s]] - n hN;\nwgt[p_] := wgt[p] = 1/Product[xP[p] - xP[q], {q, DeleteCases[poles, p]}];\nins[1][x_] := 1; ins[2][x_] := Exp[2 Pi I x/hN];\nprsL1 = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}};\nrowG[A_, F_, {i_, j_}, k_] := Sum[N[wgt[p] ins[k][xP[p]], prec] With[{x = xP[p]}, {-QUm[A, j, x] F[i, x], -x QUm[A, j, x] F[i, x], QUm[A, j, x] F[i, x + hN], x QUm[A, j, x] F[i, x + hN], QUm[A, j, x - hN] F[i, x], x QUm[A, j, x - hN] F[i, x]}], {p, poles}];\ndet6[A_, F_] := Det[Flatten[Table[rowG[A, F, ij, k], {k, 2}, {ij, prsL1}], 1]];\npsiQg[A_, {n1_, n21_, n22_}] := Product[With[{t = thN[[s]]}, (QUm[A, 2, t - n21 hN] QUm[A, 3, t - n1 hN] - QUm[A, 3, t - n21 hN] QUm[A, 2, t - n1 hN]) QUm[A, 3, t - n22 hN]], {s, nL}];\npsiQ[A_] := psiQg[A, {Λ[[1]] + 1, Λ[[1]], Λ[[2]]}];\nconstDev[l_List] := Max[Abs[l/l[[1]] - 1]];\nx0ovl = Table[x0C . ketC[[A]], {A, nS}];\nsm23 = siteMono[{2, 3}, 3]; vacL = labIdx[vacTrip];\ncheckVac[w_] := Module[{vd = vacData[w], ovl, d6, r6},\n  ovl = Table[vd[\"Om2\"] . ketC[[A]], {A, nS}];\n  d6 = Table[det6[A, FvacOf[w]], {A, nS}];\n  r6 = Table[(ovl[[A]]/x0ovl[[A]])/(d6[[A]]/psiQ[A]), {A, nS}];\n  {vd[\"eigOK\"], vd[\"deg\"], sizeQ[vd[\"resid\"]], sizeQ[constDev[r6]], N[Min[Abs[d6]], 3], N[r6[[1]], 10]}];\n{tims[\"det6 regression w\"], chk6w} = AbsoluteTiming[checkVac[wN]];\n{tims[\"det6 regression w'\"], chk6wp} = AbsoluteTiming[checkVac[wP]];\nchecks[\"psiQ[A] equals the product of the two vacuum monomials M^(1)_vac M^(2)_vac (rows {2,3}, k=3), max rel dev\"] = Max[Table[Abs[psiQ[A]/(sm23[[A, 1, vacL]] sm23[[A, 2, vacL]]) - 1], {A, nS}]];\nGrid[{{\"Omega_c[w] (x) Omega_c[w] exact eigen-covector of t_a with twist G(w), a = 1,2,3 (nodes and 2/9): w, w'\", {chk6w[[1]], chk6wp[[1]]}}, {\"vacuum direct q degrees (expect 0, 2, 4 adjoint / 0, 4, 6 for [3,1,0]): w, w'\", {chk6w[[2]], chk6wp[[2]]}}, {\"vacuum Baxter residual: w, w'\", {chk6w[[3]], chk6wp[[3]]}}, {\"det6[F_vac,w]/Psi_Q vs <Omega Omega|psi>/<x0|psi>: max |ratio/ratio[1] - 1| over all states: w, w'\", {chk6w[[4]], chk6wp[[4]]}}, {\"min |det6|: w, w'\", {chk6w[[5]], chk6wp[[5]]}}, {\"the constant ratio6[1]: w, w'\", {chk6w[[6]], chk6wp[[6]]}}, {\"Psi_Q = M1_vac M2_vac (max rel dev)\", N[checks[\"psiQ[A] equals the product of the two vacuum monomials M^(1)_vac M^(2)_vac (rows {2,3}, k=3), max rel dev\"], 3]}, {\"times (s): det6 regression w, w'\", {tims[\"det6 regression w\"], tims[\"det6 regression w'\"]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
