  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c08_t0_det6` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c08_t0_det6\", 1.09, {{\"Omega_c[w] (x) Omega_c[w] exact eigen-covector of t_a with twist G(w), a = 1,2,3 (nodes and 2/9): w, w'\", {True, True}}, \n  {\"vacuum direct q degrees (expect 0, 2, 4 adjoint / 0, 4, 6 for [3,1,0]): w, w'\", {{0, 2, 4}, {0, 2, 4}}}, {\"vacuum Baxter residual: w, w'\", {2.3239370955921577*^-52, 1.7085138336658221*^-53}}, \n  {\"det6[F_vac,w]/Psi_Q vs <Omega Omega|psi>/<x0|psi>: max |ratio/ratio[1] - 1| over all states: w, w'\", {5.6992472295014834*^-46, 4.475569596109076*^-44}}, \n  {\"min |det6|: w, w'\", {0.0536382453592080685, 0.1149494164196514452}}, {\"the constant ratio6[1]: w, w'\", \n   {3.2484375896106551219428641992544*^-7 + 8.6554310043178713273181577145865*^-7*I, 1.6192674621444195719496859543911*^-7 - \n     1.5481782146074973800727778455269*^-7*I}}, {\"Psi_Q = M1_vac M2_vac (max rel dev)\", 0 (acc 1e-46)}, {\"times (s): det6 regression w, w'\", {0.533631, 0.5141063}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c08_t0_det6\", 4.67, {{\"Omega_c[w] (x) Omega_c[w] exact eigen-covector of t_a with twist G(w), a = 1,2,3 (nodes and 2/9): w, w'\", {True, True}}, \n  {\"vacuum direct q degrees (expect 0, 2, 4 adjoint / 0, 4, 6 for [3,1,0]): w, w'\", {{0, 4, 6}, {0, 4, 6}}}, {\"vacuum Baxter residual: w, w'\", {4.802492607968365*^-49, 5.943686483555583*^-51}}, \n  {\"det6[F_vac,w]/Psi_Q vs <Omega Omega|psi>/<x0|psi>: max |ratio/ratio[1] - 1| over all states: w, w'\", {4.416556146532623*^-43, 5.221479698637644*^-40}}, \n  {\"min |det6|: w, w'\", {1.6468205041167580098, 0.758720267146541013}}, {\"the constant ratio6[1]: w, w'\", \n   {9.041848422728108350759807573039*^-8 + 2.4091918965819988831273652642132*^-7*I, 1.877193855733428954258533477342*^-7 - \n     1.7947810969985034689560918183512*^-7*I}}, {\"Psi_Q = M1_vac M2_vac (max rel dev)\", 0 (acc 1e-43)}, {\"times (s): det6 regression w, w'\", {2.3365644, 2.1641805}}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
