  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 0 result — one-site vacuum and the det6 regression (the two cells above)\n\n| check | [2,1,0] | [3,1,0] |\n|---|---|---|\n| Omega_c[w] = e1 exp(E12/w1) exp(-E13/(w1 w2)) exp((w1+w2)/(w1 w2) E23) (dense MatrixExp) = gaussCov[{1/w1, -1/(w1 w2), (w1+w2)/(w1 w2)}], 4 rational w, exact | True | True |\n| first row of the 3x3 Gauss product = (1, 1/w1, 1/w1^2) and beta + alpha gamma = alpha^2, symbolic | True, True | True, True |\n| (alpha, s) = (1/w1, 1/w2): Omega_c = gaussCov[{alpha, -alpha s, alpha + s}] (polynomial in (alpha, s)) | exact | exact |\n| Omega_c[w] (x) Omega_c[w] exact left eigen-covector of t_a(x), a = 1,2,3, twist G(w1,w2,w3) (nodes and 2/9), w and w' | True, True | True, True |\n| vacuum direct q degrees (w, w') | (0,2,4), (0,2,4) | (0,4,6), (0,4,6) |\n| vacuum direct Baxter residual (w, w') | 2.3e-52, 1.7e-53 | 4.8e-49, 5.9e-51 |\n| **det6[F_vac,w]/Psi_Q vs <Omega Omega\\|psi>/<x0\\|psi>**: max \\|ratio/ratio[1] - 1\\| over ALL states (w; w') | **5.7e-46; 4.5e-44** | **4.4e-43; 5.2e-40** |\n| Psi_Q = M^(1)_vac M^(2)_vac (rows {2,3}, k = 3), max rel dev over all states | < 1e-46 | < 1e-43 |\n| times (s): det6 regression (w, w') | 0.43, 0.38 | 1.1, 1.1 |\n\nSo **Omega_c[w] (x) Omega_c[w] is proportional to det6[F_vac,w]/Psi_Q on all 64 / 225 states at 1e-45 / 1e-40 or better** (poles n = lambda3..lambda1 = 0..2 resp. 0..3 on each ladder: 6 resp. 8 poles; insertions 1 and exp(2 pi i x/h); vacuum triple (lambda1+1, lambda1, lambda2) = (3,2,1) resp. (4,3,1)) — for both reps and for both w and w'. The regression needed no bookkeeping fix.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 1: the two-site K tensor. All d2 GT covectors e_nu1 (x) e_nu2 (index (nu1-1) d1 + nu2 = kron[uv[nu1], uv[nu2]]) are expanded in the SoV covectors (left eigenvectors of B) by ONE LinearSolve with d2 unit right-hand sides, then multiplied by N_m (normalised-wavefunction units): e_nu1 (x) e_nu2 = sum_m Kt[nu, m] <x_m|/N_m. Rationalised (tolerance 1e-40) and stored as an exact SparseArray (rows nu, columns SoV state m). *)\n{tims[\"K: expansion of all d2 covectors\"], cAll} = AbsoluteTiming[LinearSolve[Transpose[vecB], IdentityMatrix[d2]]];\nchecks[\"K: expansion error of e_nu1 (x) e_nu2 in the SoV basis (max abs, all d2)\"] = Max[Abs[Transpose[vecB] . cAll - IdentityMatrix[d2]]];\nKfullT = cAll * Nm;   (* rows = SoV state m, columns = covector nu *)\nratz[x_] := Rationalize[Chop[x, 10^-40], 10^-40];\n{tims[\"K: rationalisation\"], KtRat} = AbsoluteTiming[Map[ratz, KfullT, {2}]];\nchecks[\"K: rationalisation error (max abs, prec 60 data)\"] = Max[Abs[N[KtRat, prec] - KfullT]];\nKt = SparseArray[Transpose[KtRat]];\nchecks[\"K: max denominator digits; # nonzero entries of d2^2; max |entry|\"] = {Max[IntegerLength /@ Denominator[Kt[\"NonzeroValues\"]]], {Length[Kt[\"NonzeroValues\"]], d2^2}, N[Max[Abs[Kt[\"NonzeroValues\"]]], 4]};\n{tims[\"K: exact rank\"], rkKt} = AbsoluteTiming[MatrixRank[Kt]];\nchecks[\"K: exact rank of the d2 x d2 tensor (full = d2)\"] = {rkKt, d2};\nmOfPair = Association[Table[allLabs[[m]] -> m, {m, nS}]];\n(* state index of the label pair (x1, x2), x in labRule order *)\nmIdxMat = Table[mOfPair[{labRule[[x1]], labRule[[x2]]}], {x1, d1}, {x2, d1}];\nchecks[\"K: label pair <-> state bijection, d1 x d1 index matrix\"] = Sort[Flatten[mIdxMat]] === Range[d2];\nGrid[{{\"expansion error\", N[checks[\"K: expansion error of e_nu1 (x) e_nu2 in the SoV basis (max abs, all d2)\"], 3]}, {\"rationalisation error (60-digit data)\", N[checks[\"K: rationalisation error (max abs, prec 60 data)\"], 3]}, {\"max denominator digits; {# nonzero, d2^2}; max |entry|\", checks[\"K: max denominator digits; # nonzero entries of d2^2; max |entry|\"]}, {\"exact rank, d2\", checks[\"K: exact rank of the d2 x d2 tensor (full = d2)\"]}, {\"bijection state <-> (x1, x2)\", checks[\"K: label pair <-> state bijection, d1 x d1 index matrix\"]}, {\"times (s): solve, rationalise, rank\", {tims[\"K: expansion of all d2 covectors\"], tims[\"K: rationalisation\"], tims[\"K: exact rank\"]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
