  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c09_t1_K` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c09_t1_K\", 0.15, {{\"expansion error\", 1.37500217050283783499763177*^-89}, {\"rationalisation error (60-digit data)\", 3.3690892103943560683749*^-74}, \n  {\"max denominator digits; {# nonzero, d2^2}; max |entry|\", {8, {278, 4096}, 10.4749103942652329749}}, {\"exact rank, d2\", {64, 64}}, {\"bijection state <-> (x1, x2)\", True}, \n  {\"times (s): solve, rationalise, rank\", {0.0379027, 0.0679283, 0.0013826}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c09_t1_K\", 2.49, {{\"expansion error\", 7.60908496838960895018705*^-150}, {\"rationalisation error (60-digit data)\", 3.62519210676971080721004*^-73}, \n  {\"max denominator digits; {# nonzero, d2^2}; max |entry|\", {12, {2051, 50625}, 95.2495313964386129334}}, {\"exact rank, d2\", {225, 225}}, {\"bijection state <-> (x1, x2)\", True}, \n  {\"times (s): solve, rationalise, rank\", {1.3130051, 0.700267, 0.0245787}}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
