  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 1 regression: the slices of the two-site K reproduce the one-site K maps, which are RECOMPUTED here by independent d1-right-hand-side solves (the general notebook's site-1 maps Kg[c2] and Stage A's site-2 maps Kh[x1]). nu2 = 1 slice: Kt[(nu1,1), m] against Kg[c2][nu1, x1] with m = state (x1, (lambda1|lambda1 c2)); nu1 = 1 slice: Kt[(1,nu2), m] against Kh[x1][nu2, x2]. *)\ngrp[c2_] := {-1 - Λ[[1]], -Λ[[1]], -c2};\n(* site-1 maps (general notebook): covectors e_nu (x) e1 *)\n{tims[\"slice check: site-1 solve\"], cS1 } = AbsoluteTiming[LinearSolve[Transpose[vecB], Transpose[Table[N[UnitVector[d2, (nu - 1) d1 + 1], prec], {nu, d1}]]]];\nKfull1 = cS1 * Nm;\nKg = Association[Table[c2 -> Table[ratz[Kfull1[[mOfPair[{labRule[[x]], grp[c2]}], nu]]], {nu, d1}, {x, d1}], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}]];\nsl1 = Table[Table[Kt[[(nu - 1) d1 + 1, mOfPair[{labRule[[x]], grp[c2]}]]], {nu, d1}, {x, d1}], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}];\nchecks[\"slice nu2 = 1 of Kt equals the recomputed one-site maps Kg[c2] (exact, all c2)\"] = And @@ Table[sl1[[c2 + 1]] === Kg[c2], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}];\n(* support of the nu2 = 1 slice: only site-2 labels (lambda1|lambda1 c2)? *)\nsupp1 = Select[Range[nS], Max[Abs[Normal[Kt[[Table[(nu - 1) d1 + 1, {nu, d1}], #]]]]] > 0 &];\nsite2Labs1 = Union[allLabs[[supp1, 2]]];\nchecks[\"slice nu2 = 1: # support states, site-2 labels = {(lambda1|lambda1 c2)} exactly?\"] = {Length[supp1], Sort[site2Labs1] === Sort[Table[grp[c2], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}]]};\n(* site-2 maps (Stage A): covectors e1 (x) e_nu *)\n{tims[\"slice check: site-2 solve\"], cS2 } = AbsoluteTiming[LinearSolve[Transpose[vecB], Transpose[Table[N[UnitVector[d2, nu], prec], {nu, d1}]]]];\nKfull2 = cS2 * Nm;\nKh = Association[Table[x1 -> Table[ratz[Kfull2[[mIdxMat[[x1, x2]], nu]]], {nu, d1}, {x2, d1}], {x1, d1}]];\nsl2 = Association[Table[x1 -> Table[Kt[[nu, mIdxMat[[x1, x2]]]], {nu, d1}, {x2, d1}], {x1, d1}]];\nchecks[\"slice nu1 = 1 of Kt equals the recomputed site-2 maps Kh[x1] (exact, all x1)\"] = And @@ Table[sl2[x1] === Kh[x1], {x1, d1}];\nsupp2 = Select[Range[nS], Max[Abs[Normal[Kt[[Range[d1], #]]]]] > 0 &];\nfamS1 = Table[grp[c1], {c1, 0, Λ[[2]]}];\nchecks[\"slice nu1 = 1: # support states (Stage A: 35 / 103), # with site-1 label (lambda1|lambda1 c1) (15 / 29)\"] = {Length[supp2], Count[allLabs[[supp2, 1]], l_ /; MemberQ[famS1, l]]};\nGrid[{{\"nu2 = 1 slice of Kt = recomputed Kg[c2] (exact)\", checks[\"slice nu2 = 1 of Kt equals the recomputed one-site maps Kg[c2] (exact, all c2)\"]}, {\"nu2 = 1 slice: {# states, site-2 labels exactly the lambda2+1 groups}\", checks[\"slice nu2 = 1: # support states, site-2 labels = {(lambda1|lambda1 c2)} exactly?\"]}, {\"nu1 = 1 slice of Kt = recomputed Kh[x1] (exact)\", checks[\"slice nu1 = 1 of Kt equals the recomputed site-2 maps Kh[x1] (exact, all x1)\"]}, {\"nu1 = 1 slice: {# support states, # with x1 in the vacuum family}\", checks[\"slice nu1 = 1: # support states (Stage A: 35 / 103), # with site-1 label (lambda1|lambda1 c1) (15 / 29)\"]}, {\"ranks of Kg[c2], c2 = 0..lambda2\", Table[MatrixRank[Kg[c2]], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}]}, {\"ranks of Kh[x1] per site-1 label (labRule order)\", Table[MatrixRank[Kh[x1]], {x1, d1}]}, {\"times (s)\", {tims[\"slice check: site-1 solve\"], tims[\"slice check: site-2 solve\"]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
