   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c10_t1_slices` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c10_t1_slices\", 0.05, {{\"nu2 = 1 slice of Kt = recomputed Kg[c2] (exact)\", True}, {\"nu2 = 1 slice: {# states, site-2 labels exactly the lambda2+1 groups}\", {12, True}}, \n  {\"nu1 = 1 slice of Kt = recomputed Kh[x1] (exact)\", True}, {\"nu1 = 1 slice: {# support states, # with x1 in the vacuum family}\", {35, 15}}, {\"ranks of Kg[c2], c2 = 0..lambda2\", {4, 8}}, \n  {\"ranks of Kh[x1] per site-1 label (labRule order)\", {1, 2, 4, 2, 4, 6, 4, 8}}, {\"times (s)\", {0.0073658, 0.0055704}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c10_t1_slices\", 0.2, {{\"nu2 = 1 slice of Kt = recomputed Kg[c2] (exact)\", True}, {\"nu2 = 1 slice: {# states, site-2 labels exactly the lambda2+1 groups}\", {24, True}}, \n  {\"nu1 = 1 slice of Kt = recomputed Kh[x1] (exact)\", True}, {\"nu1 = 1 slice: {# support states, # with x1 in the vacuum family}\", {103, 29}}, {\"ranks of Kg[c2], c2 = 0..lambda2\", {9, 15}}, \n  {\"ranks of Kh[x1] per site-1 label (labRule order)\", {1, 2, 4, 2, 4, 6, 5, 9, 2, 5, 9, 12, 4, 9, 15}}, {\"times (s)\", {0.0595825, 0.0558273}}}}\n```",
