  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 1 result — the two-site K tensor (the two cells above)\n\n| check | [2,1,0] | [3,1,0] |\n|---|---|---|\n| size of Kt (rows nu = (nu1,nu2), columns SoV state m) | 64 x 64 | 225 x 225 |\n| expansion error of all d2 covectors e_nu1 (x) e_nu2 in the SoV basis (max abs, 60-digit solve) | 1.4e-89 | 7.6e-150 |\n| rationalisation error (tolerance 1e-40, max abs vs the 60-digit data) | 3.4e-74 | 3.6e-73 |\n| max denominator digits of Kt | 8 | 12 |\n| # nonzero entries (of d2^2) — Kt is very sparse | 278 of 4096 (6.8 %) | 2051 of 50625 (4.1 %) |\n| exact rank of Kt | 64 (full) | 225 (full) |\n| label pairs <-> states bijective | True | True |\n| **slice nu2 = 1 equals the one-site site-1 maps Kg[c2] recomputed by an independent d1-RHS solve (exact, all c2)**; its support = 12 / 24 states, site-2 labels exactly the lambda2+1 groups (lambda1\\|lambda1 c2) | True; 12; True | True; 24; True |\n| **slice nu1 = 1 equals Stage A's site-2 maps Kh[x1] recomputed independently (exact, all x1)**; # support states (Stage A: 35 / 103), # with site-1 label in F1 (Stage A: 15 / 29) | True; 35, 15 | True; 103, 29 |\n| ranks of Kg[c2] (c2 = 0..lambda2) | 4, 8 | 9, 15 |\n| ranks of Kh[x1] (labRule order) | 1,2,4,2,4,6,4,8 | 1,2,4,2,4,6,5,9,2,5,9,12,4,9,15 |\n| **z-independence**: Kt rebuilt at z' = (3/2,5/4,3/7) and z'' = (2,5/4,2/3) is IDENTICAL (exact rationals; driver cell) | True, True | True, True |\n| overlap identity from phi (the two-site analogue, all states, generic pair) | 1e-45 | 1e-42 |\n| times (s): solve + rationalise + rank | 0.15 | 1.2 |\n\nAlso: the K tensor is z-independent because the SoV covectors (left eigenvectors of the untwisted B) and N_m do not depend on z. The (h, theta)-dependence is rational in t = theta12/h (K rebuilt at (1/3,(1/5,-4/9)) and (1/2,(3/7,-1/4)) in the driver).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Tools for Tasks 2-5. (i) 2-form and wedge tools (general notebook cell 16): minors of the ladder points, tensorOf, amat, wedgeV, Pfaffians, decompForm. (ii) the two-site map phiMat: covector Phi (length d2) -> exact d1 x d1 matrix phi[x1, x2] of SoV coefficients (labels in labRule order). (iii) the (c, c') blocks A^(c,c') = nMin x nMin matrices (rows: ladder-1 minors (n1 n1'), columns: ladder-2 minors), the lower bound r = MatrixRank and the upper bound P = sum_k (rank u_k/2)(rank w_k/2) of the pivot rank decomposition (both orientations, smaller kept), the block-form overlap identity with explicit bracket products on all states. *)\nmnL = Flatten[Table[{mPts[[i]], mPts[[j]]}, {j, 2, pPts}, {i, 1, j - 1}], 1];\nnMin = Length[mnL];\nmnIdxA = Association[Thread[mnL -> Range[nMin]]];\nmnIdx[{n_, np_}] := mnIdxA[{n, np}];\nslotOf = Table[mnIdx[{labRule[[x, 1]], labRule[[x, 2]]}], {x, d1}];\ncOf = Table[-labRule[[x, 3]], {x, d1}];\nlabName[l_] := \"(\" <> ToString[-1 - l[[1]]] <> \"|\" <> ToString[-l[[2]]] <> ToString[-l[[3]]] <> \")\";\n(* tensorOf: vector over labels (labRule order) -> nMin x (lambda2+1) matrix, slot ((n,n'), c) *)\ntensorOf[φ_] := Module[{CC = ConstantArray[0, {nMin, Λ[[2]] + 1}]}, Do[CC[[slotOf[[x]], cOf[[x]] + 1]] = φ[[x]], {x, d1}]; CC];\namat[A_] := Table[Which[i == j, 0, i < j, A[[mnIdx[{mPts[[i]], mPts[[j]]}]]], True, -A[[mnIdx[{mPts[[j]], mPts[[i]]}]]]], {i, pPts}, {j, pPts}];\nwedgeV[F_, G_] := Flatten[Table[F[[mi]] G[[mj]] - F[[mj]] G[[mi]], {mj, 2, pPts}, {mi, 1, mj - 1}]];\npfaff[M_] := Module[{n = Length[M]}, If[n == 0, 1, If[OddQ[n], 0, Expand[Sum[(-1)^j M[[1, j]] pfaff[With[{r = Complement[Range[n], {1, j}]}, M[[r, r]]]], {j, 2, n}]]]]];\npf4list[A_] := With[{M = amat[A]}, Table[pfaff[M[[s, s]]], {s, Subsets[Range[pPts], {4}]}]];\ndecompForm[A_] := Module[{M = amat[A], res = {}, ij, F, G},\n  While[Not[AllTrue[Flatten[M], # === 0 &]],\n   ij = First[Select[Tuples[Range[pPts], 2], #[[1]] < #[[2]] && M[[#[[1]], #[[2]]]] =!= 0 &]];\n   F = M[[All, ij[[1]]]]/M[[ij[[1]], ij[[2]]]]; G = M[[All, ij[[2]]]];\n   AppendTo[res, {F, G}];\n   M = M - Table[F[[i]] G[[j]] - F[[j]] G[[i]], {i, pPts}, {j, pPts}]];\n  res];\nhalfRk[v_] := MatrixRank[amat[v]]/2;\n(* brackets on ladder s *)\nbrS[s_][A_, j_, F_] := Sum[F[[i]] vm[A, s, mPts[[i]]][[j]], {i, pPts}];\nbkS[s_][A_, F_, G_] := brS[s][A, 3, F] brS[s][A, 2, G] - brS[s][A, 2, F] brS[s][A, 3, G];\nsm23 = siteMono[{2, 3}, 3]; vacL = labIdx[vacTrip];\n(* tool checks *)\nqS[j_, m_] := qq[j, m];\nminSym[{n_, np_}] := qS[2, np] qS[3, n] - qS[3, np] qS[2, n];\nbrQ[j_, F_] := Sum[F[[i]] qS[j, mPts[[i]]], {i, pPts}];\nBk2sym[F_, G_] := brQ[3, F] brQ[2, G] - brQ[2, F] brQ[3, G];\nFs0 = Array[ff, pPts]; Gs0 = Array[gg, pPts];\nchecks[\"bracket identity Bk2[F,G] = sum (F^G)_{nn'} minor_{23}(n,n'), symbolic on all points\"] = Expand[Bk2sym[Fs0, Gs0] - Sum[wedgeV[Fs0, Gs0][[i]] minSym[mnL[[i]]], {i, nMin}]] === 0;\nSeedRandom[5];\nrF = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, pPts]; rG = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, pPts]; rF2 = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, pPts]; rG2 = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, pPts];\nchecks[\"decompForm reconstructs a random rank-4 form\"] = (Total[wedgeV[#[[1]], #[[2]]] & /@ decompForm[wedgeV[rF, rG] + wedgeV[rF2, rG2]]] === wedgeV[rF, rG] + wedgeV[rF2, rG2]);\n(* the two-site map *)\nphiMat[Φ_] := ArrayReshape[Normal[Φ . Kt][[Flatten[mIdxMat]]], {d1, d1}];\novlExactTwo[Φ_, A_] := (Φ . ketC[[A]])/(x0C . ketC[[A]]);\nidFull[Φ_] := Module[{ph = phiMat[Φ], lhs, rhs},\n  lhs = Table[ovlExactTwo[Φ, A] sm23[[A, 1, vacL]] sm23[[A, 2, vacL]], {A, nS}];\n  rhs = Table[sm23[[A, 1]] . ph . sm23[[A, 2]], {A, nS}];\n  Max[Abs[lhs - rhs]]/Max[Abs[lhs]]];\n(* blocks *)\nblockOf[ph_] := Association[Table[{c1, cp} -> Module[{M = ConstantArray[0, {nMin, nMin}]}, Do[If[cOf[[x1]] == c1, Do[If[cOf[[x2]] == cp, M[[slotOf[[x1]], slotOf[[x2]]]] = ph[[x1, x2]]], {x2, d1}]], {x1, d1}]; M], {c1, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {cp, 0, Λ[[2]]}]];\n(* matrix-rank decomposition M = Bc . R (R = row-reduced basis, Bc = pivot columns): count sum_k (rank/2)(rank/2); both orientations, smaller kept *)\nblockCountOne[M_] := Module[{R = DeleteCases[RowReduce[M], {0 ..}], piv, Bc}, If[R === {}, Return[{0, 0, {}, M, {}}]]; piv = Table[First[Flatten[Position[R[[k]], x_ /; x =!= 0, {1}, Heads -> False]]], {k, Length[R]}]; Bc = M[[All, piv]]; {Length[R], Sum[halfRk[Bc[[All, k]]] halfRk[R[[k]]], {k, Length[R]}], Table[{halfRk[Bc[[All, k]]], halfRk[R[[k]]]}, {k, Length[R]}], Bc, R}];\nblockCount[M_] := With[{a = blockCountOne[M], b = blockCountOne[Transpose[M]]}, If[a[[2]] <= b[[2]], Append[a, \"rows\"], {b[[1]], b[[2]], Reverse /@ b[[3]], Transpose[b[[5]]], Transpose[b[[4]]], \"cols\"}]];\n(* table row per block: {slots, r, P, {(rank u/2, rank w/2) per rank-1 term}, lower, upper both orientations} *)\nblockInfo[M_] := Module[{a = blockCountOne[M], b = blockCountOne[Transpose[M]], bc = blockCount[M]}, <|\"slots\" -> Count[Flatten[M], x_ /; x =!= 0], \"r\" -> MatrixRank[M], \"P\" -> bc[[2]], \"factors\" -> bc[[3]], \"Prows\" -> a[[2]], \"Pcols\" -> b[[2]]|>];\n(* the block-form identity with explicit bracket products: sum_{c,c'} v3(theta1 - c h) v3(theta2 - c' h) sum_k [sum wedges Bk2^(1)][sum wedges Bk2^(2)] = <Phi|Psi>/<x0|Psi> M1vac M2vac, all states *)\nblockTerms[bg_] := Flatten[Table[Module[{bc = blockCount[bg[{c1, cp}]]}, If[bc[[2]] == 0, {}, Flatten[Table[Flatten[Table[{c1, cp, u, w}, {u, decompForm[bc[[4, All, k]]]}, {w, decompForm[bc[[5, k]]]}], 1], {k, Length[bc[[5]]]}], 1]]], {c1, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {cp, 0, Λ[[2]]}], 2];\nidBlock[Φ_, bg_] := Module[{lhs, rhs, terms = blockTerms[bg]},\n  lhs = Table[ovlExactTwo[Φ, A] sm23[[A, 1, vacL]] sm23[[A, 2, vacL]], {A, nS}];\n  rhs = Table[Sum[vm[A, 1, -t[[1]]][[3]] vm[A, 2, -t[[2]]][[3]] bkS[1][A, t[[3, 1]], t[[3, 2]]] bkS[2][A, t[[4, 1]], t[[4, 2]]], {t, terms}], {A, nS}];\n  {Length[terms], Max[Abs[lhs - rhs]]/Max[Abs[lhs]]}];\n(* one-site column counts (rank/2 summed over the (group, column) 2-forms): site-1 tensors per site-2 label x2 and site-2 tensors per site-1 label x1 of a coefficient matrix phi *)\nperLabelCount[ph_, site_] := Total[Flatten[Table[Table[MatrixRank[amat[tensorOf[If[site == 1, ph[[All, x]], ph[[x]]]][[All, c + 1]]]]/2, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}], {x, d1}]]];\ngen0 = {2/3, -3/7, 5/4}; gen1 = {-1/2, 4/9, 3/5};\ncovGen = Normal[gaussCov[gen0]]; covGen1 = Normal[gaussCov[gen1]];\nSeedRandom[11]; covRnd = RandomInteger[{-9, 9}, d1]; covRnd2 = RandomInteger[{-9, 9}, d1];\nphTest = phiMat[kron[covGen, covGen1]];\nbgTest = blockOf[phTest];\n{tims[\"tools: one block count + identity (generic pair)\"], idTest} = AbsoluteTiming[{idFull[kron[covGen, covGen1]], idBlock[kron[covGen, covGen1], bgTest]}];\nGrid[{{\"bracket identity Bk2 = sum (F^G) minor (symbolic, all points)\", checks[\"bracket identity Bk2[F,G] = sum (F^G)_{nn'} minor_{23}(n,n'), symbolic on all points\"]}, {\"decompForm reconstructs a random rank-4 form\", checks[\"decompForm reconstructs a random rank-4 form\"]}, {\"ladder points, nMin (block size), # blocks\", {mPts, nMin, (Λ[[2]] + 1)^2}}, {\"generic pair (g1, g2) = ((2/3,-3/7,5/4), (-1/2,4/9,3/5)): phi-form identity (all states), block-form identity {# products, rel dev}\", {N[idTest[[1]], 3], {idTest[[2, 1]], N[idTest[[2, 2]], 3]}}}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"tools: one block count + identity (generic pair)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
