   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c11_tools` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c11_tools\", 0.33, {{\"bracket identity Bk2 = sum (F^G) minor (symbolic, all points)\", True}, {\"decompForm reconstructs a random rank-4 form\", True}, \n  {\"ladder points, nMin (block size), # blocks\", {{-3, -2, -1, 0}, 6, 4}}, \n  {\"generic pair (g1, g2) = ((2/3,-3/7,5/4), (-1/2,4/9,3/5)): phi-form identity (all states), block-form identity {# products, rel dev}\", {0 (acc 1e-45), {23, 0 (acc 1e-45)}}}, \n  {\"time (s)\", 0.2750761}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c11_tools\", 2.14, {{\"bracket identity Bk2 = sum (F^G) minor (symbolic, all points)\", True}, {\"decompForm reconstructs a random rank-4 form\", True}, \n  {\"ladder points, nMin (block size), # blocks\", {{-4, -3, -2, -1, 0}, 10, 4}}, \n  {\"generic pair (g1, g2) = ((2/3,-3/7,5/4), (-1/2,4/9,3/5)): phi-form identity (all states), block-form identity {# products, rel dev}\", {0 (acc 1e-42), {54, 0 (acc 1e-41)}}}, \n  {\"time (s)\", 2.0241192}}}\n```",
