   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c13_t2b_R` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c13_t2b_R\", 0.76, {{\"commutant dim (generated), sum of squared HW multiplicities\", {8, 8}}, {\"commutant commutes with E_ij^tot\", True}, {\"dim of {R : R T_ab = Ttilde_ab R} (expect 1)\", 1}, \n  {\"(e1 (x) e1) R = e1 (x) e1 (after normalisation)\", True}, {\"R Rinv = 1\", True}, {\"max denominator digits R, Rinv; # nonzero R, Rinv (of d2^2)\", {{7, 5, {322, 322}}, 4096}}, \n  {\"R T_ab = Ttilde_ab R at u = 19/23 (nine entries)\", True}, {\"ttilde_a R = R t_a (a = 1,2,3)\", {True, True, True}}, {\"Btilde R = R B\", True}, {\"R commutes with rho(g) (x) rho(g)\", True}, \n  {\"times (s): commutant closure, linear system, inverse (solved inside the commutant)\", {0.1706804, 0.3804263, 0.0212851}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c13_t2b_R\", 14.86, {{\"commutant dim (generated), sum of squared HW multiplicities\", {14, 14}}, {\"commutant commutes with E_ij^tot\", True}, {\"dim of {R : R T_ab = Ttilde_ab R} (expect 1)\", 1}, \n  {\"(e1 (x) e1) R = e1 (x) e1 (after normalisation)\", True}, {\"R Rinv = 1\", True}, {\"max denominator digits R, Rinv; # nonzero R, Rinv (of d2^2)\", {{10, 7, {2285, 2285}}, 50625}}, \n  {\"R T_ab = Ttilde_ab R at u = 19/23 (nine entries)\", True}, {\"ttilde_a R = R t_a (a = 1,2,3)\", {True, True, True}}, {\"Btilde R = R B\", True}, {\"R commutes with rho(g) (x) rho(g)\", True}, \n  {\"times (s): commutant closure, linear system, inverse (solved inside the commutant)\", {6.1929241, 6.6401256, 0.6550583}}}}\n```",
