  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 2b test: the R-dressed site-2 rotation (e1 (x) c2) R and (e1 (x) c2) Rinv. Expected from the mirror reading: support only on site-1 labels (lambda1|lambda1 c1) (x1 in F1), per-label automatic count 5 / 7 (site-2 ladder brackets, scalar ladder-1 factor), the adjoint conic locus in g2 with constant cc1(-t) = (t+3)/(2(t+2)), and for [3,1,0] the best locus beta + alpha gamma = alpha^2 with count 5. Both sides are tested; the undressed numbers are the Stage A ones (17 / 40). *)\ndressSides = <|\"R\" -> Rm, \"Rinv\" -> Rinv|>;\ndressedPhi[g_, side_] := kron[e1, Normal[gaussCov[g]]] . dressSides[side];\ndressInfo[g_, side_] := Module[{ph = phiMat[dressedPhi[g, side]], S},\n  S = suppSet[ph];\n  <|\"n\" -> Length[S], \"x1inF1\" -> AllTrue[S, MemberQ[famIdx, #[[1]]] &], \"nx1\" -> Length[Union[S[[All, 1]]]], \"nx2\" -> Length[Union[S[[All, 2]]]], \"cnt2\" -> perLabelCount[ph, 2], \"cnt1\" -> perLabelCount[ph, 1], \"ph\" -> ph|>];\nvacPoint[w_] := gaussParOf[Take[w, 2]];\nptsTest = <|\"generic gen1\" -> gen1, \"Om_c[w']\" -> vacPoint[wP], \"Om_c[w]\" -> vacPoint[wN]|>;\n{tims[\"dressed: supports and counts\"], dressTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[{side, k} -> dressInfo[ptsTest[k], side], {side, {\"R\", \"Rinv\"}}, {k, Keys[ptsTest]}] // Flatten]];\n(* undressed comparison *)\nundr = Association[Table[k -> With[{ph = phiMat[kron[e1, Normal[gaussCov[ptsTest[k]]]]]}, {Length[suppSet[ph]], perLabelCount[ph, 2]}], {k, Keys[ptsTest]}]];\n(* the ordering control: dressing a SITE-1 rotation, (c1 (x) e1) R and (c1 (x) e1) Rinv, and the vacuum (e1 (x) e1) R *)\nctlTab = Table[{side, With[{ph = phiMat[kron[Normal[gaussCov[gen1]], e1] . dressSides[side]]}, {Length[suppSet[ph]], perLabelCount[ph, 1], perLabelCount[ph, 2]}]}, {side, {\"R\", \"Rinv\"}}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"side, point\", \"# support pairs\", \"x1 in F1 for every pair?\", \"# distinct x1, x2\", \"per-label count, site-2 brackets (x1 scalar)\", \"per-label count, site-1 brackets\"}}, Table[{k[[1]] <> \", \" <> k[[2]], dressTab[k][\"n\"], dressTab[k][\"x1inF1\"], {dressTab[k][\"nx1\"], dressTab[k][\"nx2\"]}, dressTab[k][\"cnt2\"], dressTab[k][\"cnt1\"]}, {k, Keys[dressTab]}], {{\"undressed e1 (x) c2 (Stage A): {# support pairs, site-2 per-label count} per point\", undr, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"control (c1 (x) e1) R, Rinv at gen1: {# pairs, site-1 count, site-2 count}\", ctlTab, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"dressed: supports and counts\"], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
