  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c14_t2b_dressed` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c14_t2b_dressed\", 0.06, {{\"side, point\", \"# support pairs\", \"x1 in F1 for every pair?\", \"# distinct x1, x2\", \"per-label count, site-2 brackets (x1 scalar)\", \"per-label count, site-1 brackets\"}, \n  {\"R, generic gen1\", 12, True, {2, 8}, 5, 12}, {\"R, Om_c[w']\", 12, True, {2, 8}, 5, 12}, {\"R, Om_c[w]\", 12, True, {2, 8}, 5, 12}, {\"Rinv, generic gen1\", 36, False, {8, 8}, 17, 17}, \n  {\"Rinv, Om_c[w']\", 36, False, {8, 8}, 17, 17}, {\"Rinv, Om_c[w]\", 36, False, {8, 8}, 17, 17}, {\"undressed e1 (x) c2 (Stage A): {# support pairs, site-2 per-label count} per point\", \n   <|\"generic gen1\" -> {35, 17}, \"Om_c[w']\" -> {35, 17}, \"Om_c[w]\" -> {35, 17}|>, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"control (c1 (x) e1) R, Rinv at gen1: {# pairs, site-1 count, site-2 count}\", \n   {{\"R\", {35, 17, 17}}, {\"Rinv\", {36, 17, 17}}}, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", 0.0258378, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c14_t2b_dressed\", 0.17, {{\"side, point\", \"# support pairs\", \"x1 in F1 for every pair?\", \"# distinct x1, x2\", \"per-label count, site-2 brackets (x1 scalar)\", \"per-label count, site-1 brackets\"}, \n  {\"R, generic gen1\", 24, True, {2, 15}, 7, 24}, {\"R, Om_c[w']\", 24, True, {2, 15}, 5, 24}, {\"R, Om_c[w]\", 24, True, {2, 15}, 5, 24}, {\"Rinv, generic gen1\", 106, False, {15, 15}, 41, 41}, \n  {\"Rinv, Om_c[w']\", 106, False, {15, 15}, 41, 41}, {\"Rinv, Om_c[w]\", 106, False, {15, 15}, 41, 41}, {\"undressed e1 (x) c2 (Stage A): {# support pairs, site-2 per-label count} per point\", \n   <|\"generic gen1\" -> {103, 40}, \"Om_c[w']\" -> {101, 40}, \"Om_c[w]\" -> {103, 40}|>, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"control (c1 (x) e1) R, Rinv at gen1: {# pairs, site-1 count, site-2 count}\", \n   {{\"R\", {103, 40, 41}}, {\"Rinv\", {106, 41, 41}}}, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", 0.07565, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
