  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 2b, loci of the dressed covector (e1 (x) c2(g2)) R in the Gauss chart g2 = exp(gA E12) exp(gB E13) exp(gC E23): the support is only on the site-1 labels of F1, one ladder-2 column 2-form per (x1 in F1, c'); the 4x4 Pfaffians of the columns (rank <= 2 loci), their irreducible factors, the conic ones (gB + gA gC) = cc gA^2 with their constants, compared with cc1(t) = (t-3)/(2(t-2)) (site 1), cc1(-t) (the mirror reading) and cc1(1-t) (the undressed site 2 of Stage A); counts at points of every conic. *)\ngVars = {gA, gB, gC};\ngaussCovS = Expand /@ Normal[e1 . nexp[gA Ee[1, 2]] . nexp[gB Ee[1, 3]] . nexp[gC Ee[2, 3]]];\n{tims[\"dressed symbolic phi\"], phS} = AbsoluteTiming[Map[Expand, phiMat[kron[e1, gaussCovS] . Rm], {2}]];\nchecks[\"dressed symbolic phi: rows x1 outside F1 vanish identically\"] = AllTrue[Complement[Range[d1], famIdx], Union[Flatten[phS[[#]]]] === {0} &];\ncolPfS = Table[{x1, c, DeleteCases[Union[Factor /@ pf4list[tensorOf[phS[[x1]]][[All, c + 1]]]], 0]}, {x1, famIdx}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}];\npolysAll = Flatten[colPfS[[All, All, 3]]];\nsameUpToSign[f_, g_] := f === g || Expand[f + g] === 0;\nallFactors = Select[DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Table[FactorList[p][[2 ;;, 1]], {p, polysAll}]], sameUpToSign], Not[FreeQ[#, gA | gB | gC]] &];\nconicOf[f_] := Module[{p = Expand[f], k},\n  If[Exponent[p, gB] == 1 && Exponent[p, gC] == 1 && Exponent[p, gA] == 2 && FreeQ[Coefficient[p, gB, 1], gA | gB | gC], k = Coefficient[p, gB, 1]; With[{rem = Expand[p/k - (gB + gA gC)]}, If[FreeQ[rem, gB | gC] && Exponent[rem, gA] == 2 && Coefficient[rem, gA, 1] === 0 && Coefficient[rem, gA, 0] === 0, -Coefficient[rem, gA, 2], None]], None]];\ncc1[t_] := (t - 3)/(2 (t - 2));\nconicTabD = Select[Table[{f, conicOf[f]}, {f, allFactors}], #[[2]] =!= None &];\nnonConicD = Select[allFactors, conicOf[#] === None && Not[MatchQ[#, gA | gB | gC]] &];\nccVals = DeleteDuplicates[conicTabD[[All, 2]]];\nlabelCC[c_] := Join[If[c === cc1[tPar], {\"cc1(t)\"}, {}], If[c === cc1[-tPar], {\"cc1(-t)\"}, {}], If[c === cc1[1 - tPar], {\"cc1(1-t)\"}, {}], If[c === 0, {\"b3 = 0\"}, {}], If[c === 1, {\"vacuum family cc = 1\"}, {}]];\n(* point on the conic gB = cc gA^2 - gA gC, gA = 4, gC = 5 (rational) and the dressed count there *)\nconicPt[c_] := {4, 16 c - 20, 5};\ncntAt[g_] := dressInfo[g, \"R\"][\"cnt2\"];\ncntConic = Table[{c, labelCC[c], conicPt[c], cntAt[conicPt[c]]}, {c, ccVals}];\ncntGenD = cntAt[gen1];\nGrid[Join[{{\"rows x1 outside F1 of the symbolic dressed phi vanish\", checks[\"dressed symbolic phi: rows x1 outside F1 vanish identically\"]}, {\"4x4 Pfaffians per (x1 in F1, c'): {x1 label index, c', factored nonzero Pfaffians}\", \"\"}}, {#[[1 ;; 2]], #[[3]]} & /@ Flatten[colPfS, 1], {{\"all non-monomial irreducible factors\", allFactors}, {\"conic-type factors (gB + gA gC) = cc gA^2: {factor, cc}\", conicTabD}, {\"non-conic factors\", nonConicD}, {\"t = theta12/h; cc1(t), cc1(-t), cc1(1-t)\", {tPar, cc1[tPar], cc1[-tPar], cc1[1 - tPar]}}, {\"conic constants and the dressed count at the point (4, 16 cc - 20, 5): {cc, matches, point, count}\", cntConic}, {\"dressed count at the generic point gen1\", cntGenD}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"dressed symbolic phi\"]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
