   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c15_t2b_locus` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c15_t2b_locus\", 0.02, {{\"rows x1 outside F1 of the symbolic dressed phi vanish\", True}, {\"4x4 Pfaffians per (x1 in F1, c'): {x1 label index, c', factored nonzero Pfaffians}\", \"\"}, {{6, 0}, {}}, \n  {{6, 1}, {}}, {{8, 0}, {(66*gB^2*(167*gA^2 - 264*gB - 264*gA*gC))/3007}}, {{8, 1}, {}}, {\"all non-monomial irreducible factors\", {gB, -167*gA^2 + 264*gB + 264*gA*gC}}, \n  {\"conic-type factors (gB + gA gC) = cc gA^2: {factor, cc}\", {{-167*gA^2 + 264*gB + 264*gA*gC, 167/264}}}, {\"non-conic factors\", {}}, \n  {\"t = theta12/h; cc1(t), cc1(-t), cc1(1-t)\", {62/35, 43/16, 167/264, 66/97}}, {\"conic constants and the dressed count at the point (4, 16 cc - 20, 5): {cc, matches, point, count}\", \n   {{167/264, {\"cc1(-t)\"}, {4, -326/33, 5}, 4}}}, {\"dressed count at the generic point gen1\", 5}, {\"time (s)\", 0.0003354}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c15_t2b_locus\", 0.09, {{\"rows x1 outside F1 of the symbolic dressed phi vanish\", True}, {\"4x4 Pfaffians per (x1 in F1, c'): {x1 label index, c', factored nonzero Pfaffians}\", \"\"}, \n  {{12, 0}, {(204575*gB*(gA^2 - gB - gA*gC)*(3*gA^2*gB - gB^2 + gA*gB*gC + 2*gA^2*gC^2))/264616}}, {{12, 1}, {}}, \n  {{15, 0}, {(167*gA^2*gB^2*(404*gA^2 - 501*gB - 501*gA*gC))/6014, (-27889*gA*gB^2*(167*gA^2 - 264*gB - 264*gA*gC)*(gB + gA*gC))/264616, \n    (1503*gB^2*(3371*gA^2 - 7348*gB - 7348*gA*gC)*(gB + gA*gC)^2)/264616, (167*gB*(gA^2 - gB - gA*gC)*(1225*gA*gB + 7487*gA^2*gC - 4092*gB*gC - 4092*gA*gC^2))/84568, \n    (-167*(78376*gA^4*gB - 106043*gA^2*gB^2 + 31062*gB^3 - 113393*gA^3*gB*gC + 69474*gA*gB^2*gC - 44922*gA^4*gC^2 + 107886*gA^2*gB*gC^2 - 24552*gB^2*gC^2 + 69474*gA^3*gC^3 - 49104*gA*gB*gC^3 - \n       24552*gA^2*gC^4))/793848}}, {{15, 1}, {(167*(101*gA^2 - 66*gB - 66*gA*gC)*(gA^2 - gB - gA*gC))/1067}}, \n  {\"all non-monomial irreducible factors\", {gB, -gA^2 + gB + gA*gC, -3*gA^2*gB + gB^2 - gA*gB*gC - 2*gA^2*gC^2, gA, 404*gA^2 - 501*gB - 501*gA*gC, 167*gA^2 - 264*gB - 264*gA*gC, gB + gA*gC, \n    -3371*gA^2 + 7348*gB + 7348*gA*gC, 1225*gA*gB + 7487*gA^2*gC - 4092*gB*gC - 4092*gA*gC^2, 78376*gA^4*gB - 106043*gA^2*gB^2 + 31062*gB^3 - 113393*gA^3*gB*gC + 69474*gA*gB^2*gC - 44922*gA^4*gC^2 + \n     107886*gA^2*gB*gC^2 - 24552*gB^2*gC^2 + 69474*gA^3*gC^3 - 49104*gA*gB*gC^3 - 24552*gA^2*gC^4, 101*gA^2 - 66*gB - 66*gA*gC}}, \n  {\"conic-type factors (gB + gA gC) = cc gA^2: {factor, cc}\", {{-gA^2 + gB + gA*gC, 1}, {404*gA^2 - 501*gB - 501*gA*gC, 404/501}, {167*gA^2 - 264*gB - 264*gA*gC, 167/264}, \n    {-3371*gA^2 + 7348*gB + 7348*gA*gC, 3371/7348}, {101*gA^2 - 66*gB - 66*gA*gC, 101/66}}}, \n  {\"non-conic factors\", {-3*gA^2*gB + gB^2 - gA*gB*gC - 2*gA^2*gC^2, gB + gA*gC, 1225*gA*gB + 7487*gA^2*gC - 4092*gB*gC - 4092*gA*gC^2, \n    78376*gA^4*gB - 106043*gA^2*gB^2 + 31062*gB^3 - 113393*gA^3*gB*gC + 69474*gA*gB^2*gC - 44922*gA^4*gC^2 + 107886*gA^2*gB*gC^2 - 24552*gB^2*gC^2 + 69474*gA^3*gC^3 - 49104*gA*gB*gC^3 - \n     24552*gA^2*gC^4}}, {\"t = theta12/h; cc1(t), cc1(-t), cc1(1-t)\", {62/35, 43/16, 167/264, 66/97}}, \n  {\"conic constants and the dressed count at the point (4, 16 cc - 20, 5): {cc, matches, point, count}\", {{1, {\"vacuum family cc = 1\"}, {4, -4, 5}, 5}, {404/501, {}, {4, -3556/501, 5}, 7}, \n    {167/264, {\"cc1(-t)\"}, {4, -326/33, 5}, 7}, {3371/7348, {}, {4, -23256/1837, 5}, 7}, {101/66, {}, {4, 148/33, 5}, 6}}}, {\"dressed count at the generic point gen1\", 7}, {\"time (s)\", 0.0030455}}}\n```",
