   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c16_t3_blocks` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c16_t3_blocks\", 2.74, {{\"Phi\", \"# support pairs\", \"blocks (c,c') -> {slots, r, P, P(rows), P(cols)}\", \"sum r (lower bound)\", \"sum P (upper bound)\", \"sum P rows / cols orientation\", \n   \"phi-form identity (rel dev)\", \"block bracket identity {# products, rel dev}\"}, {\"a: generic pair g1 x g2\", 64, {{0, 0} -> {25, 5, 10, 10, 10}, {0, 1} -> {15, 3, 5, 6, 5}, \n    {1, 0} -> {15, 3, 5, 5, 6}, {1, 1} -> {9, 3, 3, 3, 3}}, 14, 23, {24, 24}, 0 (acc 1e-45), {23, 0 (acc 1e-45)}}, \n  {\"b: random covectors\", 64, {{0, 0} -> {25, 5, 10, 10, 10}, {0, 1} -> {15, 3, 5, 6, 5}, {1, 0} -> {15, 3, 5, 5, 6}, {1, 1} -> {9, 3, 3, 3, 3}}, 14, 23, {24, 24}, 0 (acc 1e-48), \n   {23, 0 (acc 1e-48)}}, {\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\", 64, {{0, 0} -> {25, 5, 10, 10, 10}, {0, 1} -> {15, 3, 3, 6, 3}, {1, 0} -> {15, 3, 3, 3, 6}, {1, 1} -> {9, 2, 2, 2, 2}}, 13, 18, {21, 21}, \n   0 (acc 1e-45), {18, 0 (acc 1e-45)}}, {\"c2: Om[w'] x Om[w']\", 64, {{0, 0} -> {25, 5, 10, 10, 10}, {0, 1} -> {15, 3, 3, 6, 3}, {1, 0} -> {15, 3, 3, 3, 6}, {1, 1} -> {9, 2, 2, 2, 2}}, \n   13, 18, {21, 21}, 0 (acc 1e-44), {18, 0 (acc 1e-44)}}, {\"d1: Om[w] x Om[w']\", 64, {{0, 0} -> {25, 5, 10, 10, 10}, {0, 1} -> {15, 3, 5, 6, 5}, {1, 0} -> {15, 3, 5, 5, 6}, \n    {1, 1} -> {9, 2, 2, 2, 2}}, 13, 22, {23, 23}, 0 (acc 1e-44), {22, 0 (acc 1e-43)}}, \n  {\"d2: Om[w'] x Om[w]\", 64, {{0, 0} -> {25, 5, 10, 10, 10}, {0, 1} -> {15, 3, 5, 6, 5}, {1, 0} -> {15, 3, 5, 5, 6}, {1, 1} -> {9, 2, 2, 2, 2}}, 13, 22, {23, 23}, 0 (acc 1e-44), \n   {22, 0 (acc 1e-44)}}, {\"e1: Om[w] x e1\", 12, {{0, 0} -> {3, 1, 1, 1, 1}, {0, 1} -> {5, 1, 2, 2, 2}, {1, 0} -> {1, 1, 1, 1, 1}, {1, 1} -> {3, 1, 1, 1, 1}}, 4, 5, {5, 5}, \n   0 (acc 1e-47), {5, 0 (acc 1e-47)}}, {\"e2: e1 