   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 3, det6 regression and the decisive comparison (plan section 6). (i) The vacuum Omega_c[w] (x) Omega_c[w] is a single det6; its Laplace expansion along the three ladder-1 rows has Binomial[6,3] = 20 terms (3x3 ladder-1 minor x complementary 3x3 ladder-2 minor), so the matrix rank of a block is bounded by min(20, nMin) = nMin: the Laplace bound is NOT binding on the matrix ranks; the visible signature of a single determinant is the lower block ranks / counts of the vacuum compared with the generic pair, and the rank of the d1 x d1 coefficient matrix phi. (ii) Counts of the one-site families, products, and the pair (d). *)\nrkPhi = Association[Table[k -> MatrixRank[phiMat[phis[k]]], {k, Keys[phis]}]];\nrkTab = Table[{k, blkTab[k][\"sumR\"], blkTab[k][\"sumP\"], rkPhi[k]}, {k, Keys[phis]}];\ncnt[k_] := blkTab[k][\"sumP\"];\noneSite = <|\"site-1, generic c1 (x) e1\" -> cnt[\"f1: c1(g1) x e1\"], \"site-1, Omega_c[w] (x) e1\" -> cnt[\"e1: Om[w] x e1\"], \"site-1, best locus (adjoint quadric / [3,1,0] vacuum family)\" -> cnt[\"e3: c1(best locus, site 1) x e1\"], \"site-2 undressed, generic e1 (x) c2\" -> cnt[\"f2: e1 x c2(g2)\"], \"site-2 undressed, e1 (x) Omega_c[w']\" -> cnt[\"e2: e1 x Om[w']\"], \"site-2 dressed, generic (e1 (x) c2) R\" -> cnt[\"g3: (e1 x c2(gen1)) R\"], \"site-2 dressed, (e1 (x) Omega_c[w']) R\" -> cnt[\"g: (e1 x Om[w']) R\"], \"site-2 dressed, best locus\" -> cnt[\"g2: (e1 x c2(best locus, dressed)) R\"]|>;\nprodGeneric = oneSite[\"site-1, generic c1 (x) e1\"] oneSite[\"site-2 dressed, generic (e1 (x) c2) R\"];\nprodBest = oneSite[\"site-1, best locus (adjoint quadric / [3,1,0] vacuum family)\"] oneSite[\"site-2 dressed, best locus\"];\nprodUndressed = oneSite[\"site-1, Omega_c[w] (x) e1\"] oneSite[\"site-2 undressed, e1 (x) Omega_c[w']\"];\ndec = <|\"(a) generic pair\" -> cnt[\"a: generic pair g1 x g2\"], \"(b) random covectors\" -> cnt[\"b: random covectors\"], \"(c) vacuum Om[w] x Om[w]\" -> cnt[\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\"], \"(d) Om[w] x Om[w']\" -> cnt[\"d1: Om[w] x Om[w']\"], \"(d') Om[w'] x Om[w]\" -> cnt[\"d2: Om[w'] x Om[w]\"]|>;\nnSubsets = Binomial[6, 3];\nGrid[{{\"det6 Laplace expansion: # 3-subsets of the 6 columns (terms = products of a 3x3 ladder-1 and the complementary 3x3 ladder-2 bracket minor); nMin = matrix size of a block\", {nSubsets, nMin}}, {\"rank table {Phi, sum r, sum P, MatrixRank of phi (d1 x d1)}\", Column[rkTab]}, {\"vacuum (c1) vs generic (a): block ranks\", {Table[blkTab[\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\"][\"info\"][k][\"r\"], {k, Keys[bgTest]}], Table[blkTab[\"a: generic pair g1 x g2\"][\"info\"][k][\"r\"], {k, Keys[bgTest]}]}}, {\"vacuum (c1) vs generic (a): block counts P\", {Table[blkTab[\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\"][\"info\"][k][\"P\"], {k, Keys[bgTest]}], Table[blkTab[\"a: generic pair g1 x g2\"][\"info\"][k][\"P\"], {k, Keys[bgTest]}]}}, {\"vacuum sum r <= Laplace terms; vacuum sum r < generic sum r\", {blkTab[\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\"][\"sumR\"] <= nSubsets, blkTab[\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\"][\"sumR\"] < blkTab[\"a: generic pair g1 x g2\"][\"sumR\"]}}, {\"counts (a)-(d)\", Normal[dec]}, {\"one-site block counts\", Normal[oneSite]}, {\"products: generic site 1 x generic dressed site 2 / best x best / (Omega_c[w] x e1) x undressed (e1 x Omega_c[w'])\", {prodGeneric, prodBest, prodUndressed}}, {\"(d) sum P vs these products\", {dec[\"(d) Om[w] x Om[w']\"], prodGeneric, prodBest, prodUndressed}}, {\"dim V^2, dim V\", {d2, d1}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
