   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c21_t3_decisive` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c21_t3_decisive\", 0.02, \n {{\"det6 Laplace expansion: # 3-subsets of the 6 columns (terms = products of a 3x3 ladder-1 and the complementary 3x3 ladder-2 bracket minor); nMin = matrix size of a block\", {20, 6}}, \n  {\"rank table {Phi, sum r, sum P, MatrixRank of phi (d1 x d1)}\", Column[{{\"a: generic pair g1 x g2\", 14, 23, 8}, {\"b: random covectors\", 14, 23, 8}, {\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\", 13, 18, 8}, \n     {\"c2: Om[w'] x Om[w']\", 13, 18, 8}, {\"d1: Om[w] x Om[w']\", 13, 22, 8}, {\"d2: Om[w'] x Om[w]\", 13, 22, 8}, {\"e1: Om[w] x e1\", 4, 5, 2}, {\"e2: e1 x Om[w']\", 11, 15, 8}, \n     {\"f1: c1(g1) x e1\", 4, 5, 2}, {\"f2: e1 x c2(g2)\", 11, 15, 8}, {\"g: (e1 x Om[w']) R\", 4, 5, 2}, {\"h1: (e1 x Om[w']) R (rho(g1) x 1), g1 = Om[w]\", 14, 23, 8}, \n     {\"h2: (Om[w] x e1) R (1 x rho(g2)), g2 = Om[w']\", 14, 23, 8}, {\"h3: (e1 x c2(g2)) R (rho(g1) x 1), generic g1, g2\", 14, 23, 8}, {\"e3: c1(best locus, site 1) x e1\", 4, 4, 2}, \n     {\"g2: (e1 x c2(best locus, dressed)) R\", 4, 4, 2}, {\"g3: (e1 x c2(gen1)) R\", 4, 5, 2}}]}, {\"vacuum (c1) vs generic (a): block ranks\", {{5, 3, 3, 2}, {5, 3, 3, 3}}}, \n  {\"vacuum (c1) vs generic (a): block counts P\", {{10, 3, 3, 2}, {10, 5, 5, 3}}}, {\"vacuum sum r <= Laplace terms; vacuum sum r < generic sum r\", {True, True}}, \n  {\"counts (a)-(d)\", {\"(a) generic pair\" -> 23, \"(b) random covectors\" -> 23, \"(c) vacuum Om[w] x Om[w]\" -> 18, \"(d) Om[w] x Om[w']\" -> 22, \"(d') Om[w'] x Om[w]\" -> 22}}, \n  {\"one-site block counts\", {\"site-1, generic c1 (x) e1\" -> 5, \"site-1, Omega_c[w] (x) e1\" -> 5, \"site-1, best locus (adjoint quadric / [3,1,0] vacuum family)\" -> 4, \n    \"site-2 undressed, generic e1 (x) c2\" -> 15, \"site-2 undressed, e1 (x) Omega_c[w']\" -> 15, \"site-2 dressed, generic (e1 (x) c2) R\" -> 5, \"site-2 dressed, (e1 (x) Omega_c[w']) R\" -> 5, \n    \"site-2 dressed, best locus\" -> 4}}, {\"products: generic site 1 x generic dressed site 2 / best x best / (Omega_c[w] x e1) x undressed (e1 x Omega_c[w'])\", {25, 16, 75}}, \n  {\"(d) sum P vs these products\", {22, 25, 16, 75}}, {\"dim V^2, dim V\", {64, 8}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c21_t3_decisive\", 0.05, \n {{\"det6 Laplace expansion: # 3-subsets of the 6 columns (terms = products of a 3x3 ladder-1 and the complementary 3x3 ladder-2 bracket minor); nMin = matrix size of a block\", {20, 10}}, \n  {\"rank table {Phi, sum r, sum P, MatrixRank of phi (d1 x d1)}\", Column[{{\"a: generic pair g1 x g2\", 27, 54, 15}, {\"b: random covectors\", 27, 54, 15}, {\"c1: Om[w] x Om[w]\", 26, 40, 12}, \n     {\"c2: Om[w'] x Om[w']\", 26, 40, 12}, {\"d1: Om[w] x Om[w']\", 27, 54, 15}, {\"d2: Om[w'] x Om[w]\", 27, 54, 15}, {\"e1: Om[w] x e1\", 4, 5, 2}, {\"e2: e1 x Om[w']\", 22, 35, 12}, \n     {\"f1: c1(g1) x e1\", 4, 7, 2}, {\"f2: e1 x c2(g2)\", 22, 35, 12}, {\"g: (e1 x Om[w']) R\", 4, 5, 2}, {\"h1: (e1 x Om[w']) R (rho(g1) x 1), g1 = Om[w]\", 27, 54, 15}, \n     {\"h2: (Om[w] x e1) R (1 x rho(g2)), g2 = Om[w']\", 27, 54, 15}, {\"h3: (e1 x c2(g2)) R (rho(g1) x 1), generic g1, g2\", 27, 54, 15}, {\"e3: c1(best locus, site 1) x e1\", 4, 5, 2}, \n     {\"g2: (e1 x c2(best locus, dressed)) R\", 4, 5, 2}, {\"g3: (e1 x c2(gen1)) R\", 4, 7, 2}}]}, {\"vacuum (c1) vs generic (a): block ranks\", {{8, 6, 6, 6}, {9, 6, 6, 6}}}, \n  {\"vacuum (c1) vs generic (a): block counts P\", {{22, 6, 6, 6}, {18, 12, 12, 12}}}, {\"vacuum sum r <= Laplace terms; vacuum sum r < generic sum r\", {False, True}}, \n  {\"counts (a)-(d)\", {\"(a) generic pair\" -> 54, \"(b) random covectors\" -> 54, \"(c) vacuum Om[w] x Om[w]\" -> 40, \"(d) Om[w] x Om[w']\" -> 54, \"(d') Om[w'] x Om[w]\" -> 54}}, \n  {\"one-site block counts\", {\"site-1, generic c1 (x) e1\" -> 7, \"site-1, Omega_c[w] (x) e1\" -> 5, \"site-1, best locus (adjoint quadric / [3,1,0] vacuum family)\" -> 5, \n    \"site-2 undressed, generic e1 (x) c2\" -> 35, \"site-2 undressed, e1 (x) Omega_c[w']\" -> 35, \"site-2 dressed, generic (e1 (x) c2) R\" -> 7, \"site-2 dressed, (e1 (x) Omega_c[w']) R\" -> 5, \n    \"site-2 dressed, best locus\" -> 5}}, {\"products: generic site 1 x generic dressed site 2 / best x best / (Omega_c[w] x e1) x undressed (e1 x Omega_c[w'])\", {49, 25, 175}}, \n  {\"(d) sum P vs these products\", {54, 49, 25, 175}}, {\"dim V^2, dim V\", {225, 15}}}}\n```",
