   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c17_t4_symbolic` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c17_t4_symbolic\", 0.04, {{\"symbolic phi at (a1,s1,a2,s2) = (1/w1, 1/w2, 1/w1', 1/w2') equals the numeric phi\", True}, {\"max total degree per variable in phi; max # terms of an entry\", {3, 12}}, \n  {\"block keys\", {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}}}, {\"generic ranks at 3 random points\", {{5, 3, 3, 2}, {5, 3, 3, 2}, {5, 3, 3, 2}}}, {\"generic ranks (max)\", {5, 3, 3, 2}}, \n  {\"times (s): symbolic phi, generic ranks\", {0.0054405, 0.0055707}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c17_t4_symbolic\", 0.11, {{\"symbolic phi at (a1,s1,a2,s2) = (1/w1, 1/w2, 1/w1', 1/w2') equals the numeric phi\", True}, {\"max total degree per variable in phi; max # terms of an entry\", {5, 22}}, \n  {\"block keys\", {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}}}, {\"generic ranks at 3 random points\", {{9, 6, 6, 6}, {8, 6, 6, 6}, {9, 6, 6, 6}}}, {\"generic ranks (max)\", {9, 6, 6, 6}}, \n  {\"times (s): symbolic phi, generic ranks\", {0.0542303, 0.0203444}}}}\n```",
