   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c19_t5_onesite` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c19_t5_onesite\", 2.0300000000000002, {{\"symbolic phi (A), (B) agree with numerics\", {True, True}}, {\"(A) site 2 = Omega_c[w'] fixed, g1 free: generic ranks per block (0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)\", \n   {5, 3, 3, 2}}, {\"(A) rank-drop hypersurfaces per block (common factors of det(PAQ))\", {{0, 0} -> {\"common factors\", {{\"degree 12\", \"167 terms\", {gA, gB, gC}}}}, {0, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, \n    {1, 0} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, {1, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {}}}}, {\"(A) locus tables {locus, r per block (min,max), sum P (min, max)}\", \n   Column[{{\"generic g1\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {22, 22}}, {\"vacuum family b3 = alpha^2\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {22, 22}}, \n     {\"b3 = 0\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {22, 22}}, {\"conic cc1(t)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {22, 22}}, {\"conic cc1(-t)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {22, 22}}, \n     {\"conic cc1(1-t)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {22, 22}}, {\"beta = 0\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {20, 20}}, {\"alpha = alpha' (surface)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, \n      {20, 20}}, {\"alpha = alpha' and vacuum family\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {18, 18}}, {\"alpha = alpha', beta = 0\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {18, 18}}}]}, \n  {\"(B) site 1 = Omega_c[w] fixed, g2 free: generic ranks per block\", {5, 3, 3, 3}}, {\"(B) rank-drop hypersurfaces per block\", \n   {{0, 0} -> {\"common factors\", {gB, {\"degree 13\", \"147 terms\", {gA, gB, gC}}}}, {0, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, {1, 0} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, \n    {1, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {gA, -4 + 25*gB + 10*gC, gA^2 - gB - gA*gC}}}}, \n  {\"(B) locus tables\", Column[{{\"generic g2\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, {23, 23}}, {\"vacuum family b3 = alpha^2\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {22, 22}}, \n     {\"b3 = 0\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, {22, 22}}, {\"conic cc1(t)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, {23, 23}}, {\"conic cc1(-t)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, {23, 23}}, \n     {\"conic cc1(1-t)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, {23, 23}}, {\"beta = 0\", {{3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, {16, 16}}, {\"alpha = alpha (w1' = w1, surface)\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, \n      {23, 23}}, {\"alpha = alpha and vacuum family\", {{5, 5}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {2, 2}}, {18, 18}}, {\"alpha = alpha, beta = 0\", {{3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}, {3, 3}}, {16, 16}}}]}, \n  {\"cc1(t), cc1(-t), cc1(1-t)\", {43/16, 167/264, 66/97}}, {\"times (s): symbolic phi, tables, drop loci\", {0.0202451, 1.5122393, 0.4284384}}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c19_t5_onesite\", 22.06, {{\"symbolic phi (A), (B) agree with numerics\", {True, True}}, {\"(A) site 2 = Omega_c[w'] fixed, g1 free: generic ranks per block (0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)\", {9, 6, 6, 6}}, \n  {\"(A) rank-drop hypersurfaces per block (common factors of det(PAQ))\", {{0, 0} -> {\"line section: degrees of common factors (the line meets the drop hypersurface in these points)\", {1, 27}}, \n    {0, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, {1, 0} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, {1, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {gA, -176 + 63*gA, 2232 - 16632*gA + 52283*gA^2, \n       -9300 - 10325*gA + 22698*gA^2 - 7998*gB - 7998*gA*gC, {\"degree 4\", \"10 terms\", {gA, gB, gC}}}}}}, {\"(A) locus tables {locus, r per block (min,max), sum P (min, max)}\", \n   Column[{{\"generic g1\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"vacuum family b3 = alpha^2\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, \n     {\"b3 = 0\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"conic cc1(t)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"conic cc1(-t)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, \n     {\"conic cc1(1-t)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"beta = 0\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"alpha = alpha' (surface)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, \n      {49, 49}}, {\"alpha = alpha' and vacuum family\", {{8, 8}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {40, 40}}, {\"alpha = alpha', beta = 0\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {48, 48}}}]}, \n  {\"(B) site 1 = Omega_c[w] fixed, g2 free: generic ranks per block\", {9, 6, 6, 6}}, {\"(B) rank-drop hypersurfaces per block\", \n   {{0, 0} -> {\"line section: degrees of common factors (the line meets the drop hypersurface in these points)\", {1, 23}}, {0, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, {1, 0} -> {\"common factors\", {}}, \n    {1, 1} -> {\"common factors\", {gA, -168*gA + 1144*gB + 465*gA*gB + 1330*gA*gC, {\"degree 7\", \"25 terms\", {gA, gB, gC}}, {\"degree 9\", \"58 terms\", {gA, gB, gC}}}}}}, \n  {\"(B) locus tables\", Column[{{\"generic g2\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"vacuum family b3 = alpha^2\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, \n     {\"b3 = 0\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {50, 50}}, {\"conic cc1(t)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"conic cc1(-t)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, \n     {\"conic cc1(1-t)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {54, 54}}, {\"beta = 0\", {{6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {48, 48}}, {\"alpha = alpha (w1' = w1, surface)\", {{9, 9}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, \n      {54, 54}}, {\"alpha = alpha and vacuum family\", {{8, 8}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {40, 40}}, {\"alpha = alpha, beta = 0\", {{6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}, {6, 6}}, {48, 48}}}]}, \n  {\"cc1(t), cc1(-t), cc1(1-t)\", {43/16, 167/264, 66/97}}, {\"times (s): symbolic phi, tables, drop loci\", {0.1299418, 5.4721229, 16.3528463}}}}\n```",
