  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 5, extension: type-pair scan over the 6-parameter family c1(g1) (x) c2(g2). Each site is drawn from a simple locus of the Gauss chart (generic; vacuum family b3 = alpha^2; beta = 0; gamma = 0; alpha = 0; b3 = 0; conics cc1(t), cc1(-t), cc1(1-t)); for every ordered pair of types 3 random member pairs are taken and the total count sum P (upper bound) and sum r (lower bound) are recorded (minimum over the members). Shows which pair of simple loci is cheapest (not CG-complete-tested; reach is Stage D). *)\nSeedRandom[61];\ntypeSpecs = {{\"gen\", {}}, {\"vac\", {gB -> gA^2 - gA gC}}, {\"b=0\", {gB -> 0}}, {\"g=0\", {gC -> 0}}, {\"a=0\", {gA -> 0}}, {\"b3=0\", {gB -> -gA gC}}, {\"q(t)\", {gB -> cc1[tPar] gA^2 - gA gC}}, {\"q(-t)\", {gB -> cc1[-tPar] gA^2 - gA gC}}, {\"q(1-t)\", {gB -> cc1[1 - tPar] gA^2 - gA gC}}};\ntPoint[rules_] := Module[{p = ptOnG[rules]}, gVars /. p];\npairData[ty1_, ty2_] := Module[{res},\n  res = Table[Module[{g1 = tPoint[ty1[[2]]], g2 = tPoint[ty2[[2]]], ph, bg, info}, ph = phiMat[kron[Normal[gaussCov[g1]], Normal[gaussCov[g2]]]]; bg = blockOf[ph]; info = Table[blockInfo[bg[k]], {k, Keys[bg]}]; {Total[#[\"P\"] & /@ info], Total[#[\"r\"] & /@ info]}], {3}];\n  {Min[res[[All, 1]]], Min[res[[All, 2]]]}];\n{tims[\"type scan\"], scanRes} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[pairData[t1, t2], {t1, typeSpecs}, {t2, typeSpecs}]];\nGrid[Join[{Prepend[typeSpecs[[All, 1]], \"site 1 \\\\ site 2: {sum P, sum r}\"]}, Table[Prepend[scanRes[[i]], typeSpecs[[i, 1]]], {i, Length[typeSpecs]}], {{\"min sum P over all pairs, where\", Min[scanRes[[All, All, 1]]], Flatten[Table[If[scanRes[[i, j, 1]] == Min[scanRes[[All, All, 1]]], {typeSpecs[[i, 1]], typeSpecs[[j, 1]]}, Nothing], {i, Length[typeSpecs]}, {j, Length[typeSpecs]}], 1]}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"type scan\"]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c20_t5_typescan` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c20_t5_typescan\", 7.0600000000000005, {{\"site 1 \\\\ site 2: {sum P, sum r}\", \"gen\", \"vac\", \"b=0\", \"g=0\", \"a=0\", \"b3=0\", \"q(t)\", \"q(-t)\", \"q(1-t)\"}, \n  {\"gen\", {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {16, 12}, {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {22, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}}, {\"vac\", {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {16, 12}, {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {22, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}}, \n  {\"b=0\", {21, 14}, {20, 13}, {14, 12}, {21, 14}, {20, 13}, {20, 14}, {21, 14}, {21, 14}, {21, 14}}, {\"g=0\", {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {16, 12}, {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {22, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}}, \n  {\"a=0\", {21, 13}, {21, 13}, {14, 10}, {21, 13}, {19, 13}, {20, 13}, {21, 13}, {21, 13}, {20, 13}}, {\"b3=0\", {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {16, 12}, {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {21, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}, \n   {23, 14}}, {\"q(t)\", {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {16, 12}, {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {22, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}}, {\"q(-t)\", {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {16, 12}, {23, 14}, {21, 13}, {22, 14}, {23, 14}, \n   {23, 14}, {23, 14}}, {\"q(1-t)\", {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {16, 12}, {23, 14}, {22, 13}, {22, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}, {23, 14}}, \n  {\"min sum P over all pairs, where\", 14, {{\"b=0\", \"b=0\"}, {\"a=0\", \"b=0\"}}}, {\"time (s)\", 7.0328878}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c20_t5_typescan\", 21.54, {{\"site 1 \\\\ site 2: {sum P, sum r}\", \"gen\", \"vac\", \"b=0\", \"g=0\", \"a=0\", \"b3=0\", \"q(t)\", \"q(-t)\", \"q(1-t)\"}, \n  {\"gen\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {48, 24}, {54, 27}, {50, 25}, {50, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}}, {\"vac\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {48, 24}, {54, 27}, {50, 25}, {50, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}}, \n  {\"b=0\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {48, 24}, {54, 27}, {49, 25}, {48, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}}, {\"g=0\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {48, 24}, {54, 27}, {50, 25}, {50, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}}, \n  {\"a=0\", {48, 25}, {48, 25}, {40, 20}, {48, 25}, {42, 21}, {45, 23}, {48, 25}, {48, 25}, {48, 25}}, {\"b3=0\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {47, 24}, {54, 27}, {50, 25}, {49, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}, \n   {54, 27}}, {\"q(t)\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {48, 24}, {54, 27}, {50, 25}, {50, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}}, {\"q(-t)\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {48, 24}, {54, 27}, {50, 25}, {50, 27}, {54, 27}, \n   {54, 27}, {54, 27}}, {\"q(1-t)\", {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {48, 24}, {54, 27}, {50, 25}, {50, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}, {54, 27}}, {\"min sum P over all pairs, where\", 40, {{\"a=0\", \"b=0\"}}}, \n  {\"time (s)\", 21.5025194}}}\n```",
